<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Azeri Journey's End | Haris Iqbal</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/icon.png" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
    <script src="script.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body class="case-page">
    <div class="ambient-stage" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="ambient-mesh"></span>
      <span class="ambient-sweep"></span>
      <span class="ambient-rings"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="case-shell">
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Project navigation">
        <a class="wordmark" href="index.html">Haris Iqbal</a>
        <a class="case-link" href="index.html#archive-title">Back to work</a>
      </nav>
      <main class="case-study">
        <section class="case-hero">
          <img src="assets/azeri.jpg" alt="Azeri Journey's End project artwork" />
          <div class="case-body">
            <p class="eyebrow">Unreal Engine 4 game jam</p>
            <h1>Azeri -<br />Journey's End</h1>
            <p>
              A charming shapeshifting adventure made in a week with a small
              team, following a legendary fox on a final journey to revive a
              dying world.
            </p>
            <div class="case-facts">
              <span>Animation</span>
              <span>Blueprint logic</span>
              <span>Co-design direction</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="case-rich" aria-label="Azeri details">
          <article class="detail-block">
            <p class="case-caption">About</p>
            <h2>A charming shapeshifting adventure</h2>
            <p>
              Azeri - Journey's End was made as part of a weeklong game jam with
              a group of exceptionally talented friends. The idea was to create
              a charming game with mythological elements, so the team chose an
              experience where players control the legendary shapeshifting fox
              Azeri on a final journey to breathe life back into a dying world.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="detail-block">
            <p class="case-caption">Aspects worked on</p>
            <h2>Animation, tech, and direction</h2>
            <div class="detail-columns">
              <section class="detail-group">
                <h3>Animation features</h3>
                <ul class="case-list">
                  <li>Created and implemented animations for all animals.</li>
                  <li>Cleaned up or improved marketplace animal assets used for the project.</li>
                  <li>Converted animations to use a root-based system.</li>
                  <li>Technical retargeting of quadruped animations saved creation time for iteration.</li>
                </ul>
              </section>
              <section class="detail-group">
                <h3>Tech features</h3>
                <ul class="case-list">
                  <li>Worked on technical aspects from Blueprinting to logic scripting.</li>
                  <li>Built a Montage and Notification based system that made animal archetypes quick and responsive.</li>
                  <li>Technical level scripting.</li>
                  <li>Responsive UI system.</li>
                </ul>
              </section>
              <section class="detail-group">
                <h3>Misc</h3>
                <ul class="case-list">
                  <li>Directed the design with the Co-Design Director to help guide the team vision in a short time.</li>
                  <li>Helped set up documentation and source control tools.</li>
                  <li>Completed graphical fidelity and particle effects pass work.</li>
                </ul>
              </section>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="detail-block">
            <p class="case-caption">Team credits</p>
            <h2>Collaborators</h2>
            <ul class="case-list">
              <li>Aidan Coxon - Co-Design Direction, Lighting, Level and Environment Design.</li>
              <li>Bruno Henrique - UI, UX and Art Direction.</li>
              <li>Gabriel Henrique - Narrative Design and UX.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="detail-block">
            <p class="case-caption">Project media</p>
            <h2>Azeri footage and images</h2>
            <div class="video-grid">
              <div class="video-frame">
                <iframe loading="lazy" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lqgoRGwv9Rs" title="Azeri portfolio video" allowfullscreen></iframe>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="media-grid">
              <img loading="lazy" src="https://harisiqbalportfolio.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/image-2.png?w=1024" alt="Azeri project image one" />
              <img loading="lazy" src="https://harisiqbalportfolio.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/ccb8mr.png?w=1024" alt="Azeri project image two" />
              <img loading="lazy" src="https://harisiqbalportfolio.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/wp81ww.png?w=1024" alt="Azeri project image three" />
              <img loading="lazy" src="https://harisiqbalportfolio.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/spidergoat.jpg?w=1024" alt="Azeri project image four" />
              <img loading="lazy" src="https://harisiqbalportfolio.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/cbkiii.jpg?w=1024" alt="Azeri project image five" />
              <img loading="lazy" src="https://harisiqbalportfolio.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/phz2h0.jpg?w=1024" alt="Azeri project image six" />
            </div>
          </article>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
